<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank sets next two repos at fixed 3.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank sets next two repos at fixed 3.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Thurday that it would set its next two securities repurchase tenders at a fixed interest rate of three percent.</p>
<p>The German central bank has held its repo rate steady at a fixed three percent since August 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
